{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water of M is a challenging puzzle game. Unlike traditional puzzle titles, it blends in action elements such as combat and jumping, making every puzzle tenser and more rhythm-driven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the same time, Water of M is also a survival horror experience: in this corpse-strewn school, you must evade relentless enemies and move with caution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/e78867470d0c3adc3adf209006b44b9d.poster.avif?t=1773592082\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/e78867470d0c3adc3adf209006b44b9d.webm?t=1773592082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/e78867470d0c3adc3adf209006b44b9d.mp4?t=1773592082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you push deeper, you\u2019ll gradually uncover the truth behind the school\u2014perhaps it isn\u2019t a school at all, but a \u201cparanormal research facility.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water of M. Legend says it grants immortality, but here, \u201cobtaining\u201d is never the same as \u201ckeeping.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/46570501028d6812ca3e14a7d4d4ad41.poster.avif?t=1773592082\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/46570501028d6812ca3e14a7d4d4ad41.webm?t=1773592082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/46570501028d6812ca3e14a7d4d4ad41.mp4?t=1773592082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Experience:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor your horror experience with toggleable options: turn <strong>Blood &amp; Gore</strong> on/off, or enable the <strong>Retro Filter</strong> for a nostalgic visual style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A\u00a0horror\u00a0story\u00a0set\u00a0in\u00a0a\u00a0school:</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u00a0might\u00a0have\u00a0lived\u00a0through\u00a0it\u00a0once\u2026\u00a0but\u00a0you\u00a0remember\u00a0nothing.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/1251baa6b41935c46fdded41979480e8.poster.avif?t=1773592082\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/1251baa6b41935c46fdded41979480e8.webm?t=1773592082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/1251baa6b41935c46fdded41979480e8.mp4?t=1773592082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Relentless\u00a0pursuit:</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore\u00a0in\u00a0the\u00a0dark,\u00a0but\u00a0beware:\u00a0something\u00a0far\u00a0worse\u00a0than\u00a0ghosts\u00a0is\u00a0hunting\u00a0you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your\u00a0past\u00a0tricks\u00a0for\u00a0escaping\u00a0won\u2019t\u00a0work\u00a0here,\u00a0so\u00a0watch\u00a0every\u00a0step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/e412622255e293ea9dbb548f7be87ef3.poster.avif?t=1773592082\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/e412622255e293ea9dbb548f7be87ef3.webm?t=1773592082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/e412622255e293ea9dbb548f7be87ef3.mp4?t=1773592082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Numerous\u00a0puzzles:</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The\u00a0puzzles\u00a0grow\u00a0more\u00a0complex\u00a0as\u00a0the\u00a0game\u00a0progresses.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At\u00a0first,\u00a0you\u00a0might\u00a0guess\u00a0the\u00a0answers\u00a0\u2014\u00a0but\u00a0you\u00a0won\u2019t\u00a0be\u00a0able\u00a0to\u00a0guess\u00a0forever.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then\u00a0you\u2019ll\u00a0realize\u00a0you\u00a0should\u00a0have\u00a0paid\u00a0more\u00a0attention\u00a0to\u00a0the\u00a0clues\u00a0you\u00a0found\u00a0earlier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>No\u00a0cheating\u00a0allowed:</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some\u00a0puzzle\u00a0solutions\u00a0are\u00a0randomized,\u00a0making\u00a0guides\u00a0useless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Pure\u00a0intensity:</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Familiar\u00a0places\u00a0become\u00a0twisted\u00a0and\u00a0dangerous.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In\u00a0these\u00a0hallways\u00a0and\u00a0classrooms,\u00a0you\u2019ll\u00a0be\u00a0switching\u00a0between\u00a0running,\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >solving\u00a0puzzles,\u00a0and\u00a0fighting\u00a0\u2014\u00a0the\u00a0only\u00a0chance\u00a0to\u00a0catch\u00a0your\u00a0breath\u00a0might\u00a0come\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >from\u00a0meeting\u00a0your\u00a0classmates\u2026\u00a0or\u00a0maybe\u00a0not!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"P.E.: Athletic Ace","